'''Happy Birthday Cake''' (記念ケーキわんこ, "Commemorative Cake Dog") is a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemy that appears in the [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 9.8 Update|Version 9.8]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Happy Birthday Cake
|image = E 523.png
|appearance = [[♪ Birthday Party ♪|Hatsune Miku's Birthday!]]
|money drop = 2¢ - 7¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy appears to be four [[Doge]]s carrying a large birthday cake that stands on a can of Cat Food. At the top of the cake there is a red and gold colored ribbon and a sign written in gold that says Happy Birthday. The Doges remain hidden under the can but can be seen during its attack animation. Although it may not look like one, it is actually a Metal enemy.

==Strategy==
[[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] and any other fast attacking characters such as [[Mr. (Special Cat)|Mr.]] can kill this enemy very easily. It deals pretty much no damage per hit, so there's no need to worry about it at all.

